WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Four Roots Adventure. Now with deterministic replay footage from the local TEST engine.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
At the Workshop Crossroads, move with WASD or arrows and interact with E or Space.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The replay enters Truth Hollow and keeps two witnesses separate before carrying the first root.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
In Agency Garden, every lantern opens without choosing for another.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The replay repairs Continuity, takes the long look for Wisdom, and visits all five zones.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
After six quests, ten discoveries, and four ordered roots, the replay reaches A Door Into Review.
